      "id": "daedalus-film-story",
      "type": "text",
      "width": "full",
      "heading": "Making Daedalus Alpha",
      "body": "Daedalus Alpha is a seven-minute live-action short about a scientist confronting an apparent superintelligence. I developed the concept over several months, then produced, directed, and edited the film.\n\nThe production involved nine crew members, including me, and three cast members. We shot overnight, from roughly 8 PM to 8 AM. Directing performances while coordinating the production made the practical demands of the story much clearer.",
      "source": "",
      "mediaRef": "",
      "href": "",
      "label": "",
      "projectId": "",
      "alt": "",
      "fit": "cover"
    },
